        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: plant taxonomy, Greek mythology\n- Taxa: Anemopaegma, Bignoniaceae\n- People: Semele, Cadmus, Harmonia, Zeus, Dionysus\n- Places: Boeotia\n\nFacts:\n- Anemopaegma is a genus of flowering plants in the family Bignoniaceae.\n- In Greek mythology, Semele was the daughter of the Boeotian hero Cadmus and Harmonia.\n- In one Greek origin myth, Semele was the mortal mother of Dionysus by Zeus.",
